  "instructions": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "primary_message": "In a large skillet with sloped sides, melt butter with honey over medium heat, stirring to combine. Stir in chipotle chile powder to taste (I use about 6 small pinches). Add potato chips and stir gently until well coated, lowering heat to prevent scorching if necessary. Transfer to a bowl and serve warm.",
